Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 02:21:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1073/1198] LoRA music half capped at 0.75 (score adapters
 excepted), strengths typed on a double-click; an empty knob shows its
 default; Create's takes carry the Collection's marks

HERESY 1081 (Viktor 02.10.2026): a music half above 0.75 breaks the score after 70-200 tokens with every
adapter but the ABC one; new LoRAs come in at 0.75 there; old takes keep their values, the hint says so.
HERESY 1082: like, dislike, derived, workspaces and a note mark on the takes in Create, drawn by the Collection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
